{"name": "Starshapes", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Starshapes is a relaxing puzzle drawing game where your solutions become beautiful neon-like star constellations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"536\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/66d54969f6f975cd650c56630548fe76.poster.avif?t=1787074185\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/66d54969f6f975cd650c56630548fe76.webm?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/66d54969f6f975cd650c56630548fe76.mp4?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Many puzzles in Starshapes are open ended, meaning they can have multiple solutions - which ones will you find?\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"536\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/8610d774d3eec02beebf2601b3936f8e.poster.avif?t=1787074185\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/8610d774d3eec02beebf2601b3936f8e.webm?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/8610d774d3eec02beebf2601b3936f8e.mp4?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzle mechanics are simple and intuitive, but can have unexpected synergies where you will have to explore and experiment with them to find the solution and progress.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The universe of Starshapes is interconnected and exists as a seamless world with pockets of puzzles contained in each their own star system.\u00a0Certain areas are optional, while the order of the main puzzles is linear.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"536\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/f819ee99b742ab382a0bdf68f8ba7338.poster.avif?t=1787074185\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/f819ee99b742ab382a0bdf68f8ba7338.webm?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/f819ee99b742ab382a0bdf68f8ba7338.mp4?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Previously solved puzzles in the same area will be visible as constellations in the background of your current puzzle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"536\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/f9392db231141b311faee9327f117ac6.poster.avif?t=1787074185\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/f9392db231141b311faee9327f117ac6.webm?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/f9392db231141b311faee9327f117ac6.mp4?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve Puzzle Constellations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a cozy corner of the galaxy and re-imagine what star systems could look like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Starshapes features over 100 hand-made logic puzzles and almost 90 real-life constellations as bonus 'connect the dots' type puzzles! Soak in the beautiful starlight of all the puzzles you\u2019ve completed along your journey and unlock new and interesting rules as you progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"536\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/322f55fee6fb9e9e549f7062ab1cb98c.poster.avif?t=1787074185\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/322f55fee6fb9e9e549f7062ab1cb98c.webm?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/322f55fee6fb9e9e549f7062ab1cb98c.mp4?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Draw and Destroy lines between shapes to solve puzzles and create constellations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotate puzzles in 3D and Zoom In &amp; Out to view them from different angles. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Smooth and elegant animations make learning the gameplay easy and intuitive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"536\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/d5331541bab3e615396717d445005d17.poster.avif?t=1787074185\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/d5331541bab3e615396717d445005d17.webm?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/d5331541bab3e615396717d445005d17.mp4?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Accessibility &amp; QOL Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Toggle Color Symbols and Connection Numbers on or off at any time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"536\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/9f443a1e3d347a5b4ec036b34f88ee09.poster.avif?t=1787074185\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/9f443a1e3d347a5b4ec036b34f88ee09.webm?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/9f443a1e3d347a5b4ec036b34f88ee09.mp4?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"536\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/6eb2c77af949e0345747fac7ee79de03.poster.avif?t=1787074185\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/6eb2c77af949e0345747fac7ee79de03.webm?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/6eb2c77af949e0345747fac7ee79de03.mp4?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hint system: You can toggle 'Show Solution' on in any puzzle in the entire game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Undo, Redo and Reset with convenient shortcuts on both keyboard and gamepad.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"536\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/93063e19b67e4a333172eefcdfc835ea.poster.avif?t=1787074185\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/93063e19b67e4a333172eefcdfc835ea.webm?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/93063e19b67e4a333172eefcdfc835ea.mp4?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of customization options, including speedrun focused \"Smooth\" drawing modes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"536\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/dbc2e45fdb24bdbf6f659f80854bb218.poster.avif?t=1787074185\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/dbc2e45fdb24bdbf6f659f80854bb218.webm?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/dbc2e45fdb24bdbf6f659f80854bb218.mp4?t=1787074185\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A relaxing 3D puzzle game about drawing constellations in space.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/de3c1965da97077f15681750178deb5fd9e19a3c/header.jpg?t=1787074185", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["3D", "Puzzle", "Space", "Relaxing", "Exploration", "Tutorial"], "developers": "Peter Bj\u00f8rn", "publishers": "Peter Bj\u00f8rn", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2386910", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "18 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/VXgJVpfXoCA", "first_seen": 1787004000.0, "review_rank": 98}